WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.810
This is Elephants on Mars, a team game for your next video call.

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:09.760
You play in teams of four, and everyone sees a different piece of the plan.

3
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.330
The Captain holds the money,

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.960
the Vet buys the animal,

5
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.100
the Pilot buys a rocket big enough,

6
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.540
and the Engineer gathers the fuel.

7
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.510
Your phone is your console. Only the Vet can see sizes and points, so you have to talk. Fast.

8
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:41.390
Every team shares one market. Wait for a deal, or grab it before someone else does.

9
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.240
When everything fits, the Captain launches.

10
00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:48.140
Then compare notes: who landed what, and why.

11
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.210
Every animal you land helps terraform Mars.

12
00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:59.620
Host a game, share the code, and see how far your team gets.
